And when he came clean to Toby, he didn't even get in trouble for it.
而且当他向托比坦白时，他甚至没有因此惹上麻烦。

1186
00:53:16.250 --> 00:53:18.330
Jessica, I kind of thought the same thing.
杰西卡，我其实也有同感。

1187
00:53:18.970 --> 00:53:21.830
But Toby's spinning out about the Scranton Strangler.
但托比因为斯克兰顿扼杀者的事脑子有点乱。

1188
00:53:21.830 --> 00:53:22.510
Exactly.
没错。

1189
00:53:22.750 --> 00:53:24.910
Toby's in his head about his own stuff.
托比满脑子都在纠结他自己的事。

1190
