00:54:50.710 --> 00:54:51.590
He's nude.
他赤身裸体。

1226
00:54:52.110 --> 00:54:54.010
He's in the break room.
他在休息室里。

1227
00:54:54.410 --> 00:54:56.750
He has on underwear.
他穿着内裤。

1228
00:54:57.670 --> 00:55:01.070
I'm sorry, he has on his green underwear, which is his favorite.
不好意思，他穿着他最喜欢的绿色内裤。

1229
00:55:01.310 --> 00:55:02.470
His green tighty-whities.
他那条绿色的紧身三角裤。

1230
00:55:02.890 --> 00:55:03.410
Yes.
没错。

1231
00:55:03.930 --> 00:55:07.990
Yeah, Dwight is really upset because Iris Black says, you know what?
对，德怀特非常生气，因为艾瑞丝·布莱克说，你知道吗？

1232
