Yes, I got some phlegm stuck in my throat when I went to do this, and it created this weird,
对，我刚才清嗓子的时候喉咙里卡了点痰，这就弄出了这种奇怪的、

1257
00:56:06.630 --> 00:56:08.030
raspy voice.
沙哑的声音。

