The script did not specify any accent.
剧本没有规定任何口音。

1259
00:56:11.550 --> 00:56:16.670
It just said, Pam speaks, voice passably disguised.
它只写着，帕姆说话，声音要勉强伪装一下。

1260
00:56:16.990 --> 00:56:18.750
