糖果袋的备用片段里有一个凯文访谈的备用镜头，我想读一下。

1755
01:15:34.640 --> 01:15:35.100
Here it is.
在这呢。

1756
01:15:35.980 --> 01:15:39.120
Kevin says, okay, I made it through the day.
凯文说，好吧，我总算熬过今天了。

1757
01:15:39.400 --> 01:15:42.060
All I have to do now is make it through tomorrow,
我现在要做的就是熬过明天，

1758
01:15:42.060 --> 01:15:47.520
and then every day until the senator divorces Angela and comes out of the closet and resigns
然后是每一天，直到参议员和安吉拉离婚、出柜并辞去

1759
01:15:47.520 --> 01:15:48.060
from politics.
政职。

1760
01:15:48.980 --> 01:15:52.880
If he can do that by this weekend, that would be beSt. I hope he does that stuff
如果他能在本周末前做到那就太棒了。我希望他明天

1761
01:15:52.880 --> 01:15:53.240
tomorrow.
就把这些事办了。

1762
01:15:54.860 --> 01:15:55.700
That's great.
太棒了。

1763
01:15:56.080 --> 01:15:57.620
Oh, those are both good ones.
哦，这两个都很不错。

1764
01:15:59.520 --> 01:16:02.100
Well, Erin is going to return to the office.
好了，艾琳要回办公室了。

1765
01:16:02.280 --> 01:16:02.760
Why?
为什么？

1766
01:16:03.100 --> 01:16:04.900
Why did she come back to the office?
她为什么回办公室？

1767
01:16:05.280 --> 01:16:06.000
Why didn't
她怎么不

1768
01:16:06.000 --> 01:16:07.060
she just go home?
直接回家？

1769
01:16:07.600 --> 01:16:08.980
Why did she do this?
她为什么要这么做？

1770
01:16:09.100 --> 01:16:11.740
Because she had to have a really cute interaction with Pete,
因为她得和皮特有一场非常可爱的互动，

1771
01:16:11.740 --> 01:16:14.360
who is still sitting at reception manning the phones.
皮特还坐在前台接听电话。

1772
01:16:14.540 --> 01:16:15.880
Why hasn't he gone home?
他怎么还没回家？

1773
01:16:16.000 --> 01:16:16.880
I don't know.
我不知道。

1774
01:16:17.400 --> 01:16:23.860
Well, we know why he's at front reception, and they have this cute little moment where he invites
好吧，我们知道他为什么在前台，他们有个温馨可爱的小时刻，他邀请

1775
01:16:23.860 --> 01:16:25.980
her out for drinks to poor Richard's.
她去“穷理查”酒吧喝一杯。

1776
01:16:26.120 --> 01:16:26.760
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1777
01:16:27.120 --> 01:16:28.540
And she says yes.
然后她答应了。

1778
01:16:28.920 --> 01:16:29.920
She says, okay.
她说，好啊。

1779
01:16:31.440 --> 01:16:31.940
Romance.
浪漫。

1780
01:16:32.600 --> 01:16:33.100
Romance.
浪漫。

1781
01:16:33.340 --> 01:16:34.400
New romance.
新的恋情。

1782
01:16:34.940 --> 01:16:36.040
New romance.
新的恋情。

1783
01:16:36.500 --> 01:16:38.620
We've been rooting for this one for a while.
我们看好这一对已经有一段时间了。

1784
01:16:39.440 --> 01:16:41.020
Well, there you have it, everyone.
好了，各位，就是这样。

1785
01:16:41.200 --> 01:16:42.240
That's the boat.
这就是全部了。

1786
